  "releaseNotes": "SharpVision 1.3.0-beta.1 prerelease: the theme styles vocabulary is closed to the six role sections (leaf-control and vendor-dotted styles keys are now rejected), with chromatic semantic colors, theme-level glyph families, published derived interaction style sets, an expanded ChartStyle, a selectable-text and clipboard-copy foundation (ISelectableTextSource, ISelectableTextViewport, IClipboardCopySource, and related interfaces), and a ControlBase.ResolveAppearance theme preview. See https://github.com/pavkam/sharp-vision/blob/main/docs/index.md for API contracts, examples, and current support.",
